gam-pref-title = gam
gam-pref-intro = Shows the Obsidian notes of your items, and makes literature notes. gam never changes a file that exists in the vault.
gam-pref-group-vault = Vault
gam-pref-group-notes = Notes
gam-pref-group-keys = Citation keys
gam-pref-vault-help = The folder that holds the .obsidian folder.
gam-pref-literature-help = A folder in the vault. New notes go here.
gam-pref-exclude-help = Notes in these folders do not count as citations. Separate folders with commas.
gam-pref-marker-help = gam adds this tag to the Zotero note with the Obsidian link.
gam-pref-vault = Vault folder
gam-pref-vault-name = Obsidian vault name (empty: the folder name)
gam-pref-literature = Literature folder (in the vault)
gam-pref-exclude = Folders that "Cited in" leaves out
gam-pref-marker = Marker tag for the child note (empty: none)
gam-pref-open-after-create =
    .label = Open the new note in Obsidian
gam-pref-auto-key =
    .label = Give new items a citation key
gam-pref-auto-key-help = gam gives a key only to an item that has none, and never changes a key. When more than 20 items arrive at once, gam gives no keys: use Tools > Citation keys…
gam-pref-group-clean = Cleaning
gam-pref-clean-new =
    .label = Clean the titles of new items
gam-pref-clean-new-help = Spaces, final punctuation and unused tags. gam does not change the case of a title alone: use Tools > Clean library… When more than 20 items arrive at once, gam changes no titles. Turn off other plugins that change titles.
gam-pref-orphan-notice =
    .label = Tell me about files without a parent
gam-pref-terms-file = Terms file (empty: only the terms of gam)
gam-pref-terms-file-help = A text file with one term in each line, with its exact case. "#" starts a comment. "en:" or "pt:" before a term limits it to a language.
gam-pref-group-import = Import folder
gam-pref-import-on =
    .label = Import the PDF and EPUB files of a folder
gam-pref-import-folder = Import folder
gam-pref-import-folder-help = While Zotero is open, gam adds new files to My Library, and Zotero looks up the parent items. A file that is already in Zotero is not added again. gam reads the folder each 30 seconds, without its subfolders.
gam-pref-import-done = Move imported files to (empty: the subfolder "imported")
gam-pref-import-done-help = gam never deletes or overwrites a file. Use the import folder on one computer only.
